**/node_modules/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/versions

# Dependencies (Python / pip)
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

